<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Instruction Tuning on Tech Insights: AI &amp; Cloud</title><link>https://shoubhikbanerjee.github.io/blog/tags/instruction-tuning/</link><description>Recent content in Instruction Tuning on Tech Insights: AI &amp; Cloud</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 28 Oct 2025 01:06:43 +0530</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://shoubhikbanerjee.github.io/blog/tags/instruction-tuning/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Meta Llama 3.1-8B-Instruct: The Ultimate Guide to Advanced Language AI</title><link>https://shoubhikbanerjee.github.io/blog/p/meta-llama-3.1-8b-instruct-the-ultimate-guide-to-advanced-language-ai/</link><pubDate>Tue, 28 Oct 2025 01:06:43 +0530</pubDate><guid>https://shoubhikbanerjee.github.io/blog/p/meta-llama-3.1-8b-instruct-the-ultimate-guide-to-advanced-language-ai/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/646cf8084eefb026fb8fd8bc/oCTqufkdTkjyGodsx1vo1.png" alt="Featured image of post Meta Llama 3.1-8B-Instruct: The Ultimate Guide to Advanced Language AI" /&gt;&lt;h1 id="-meta-llama-31-8b-instruct-the-ultimate-guide-to-advanced-language-ai"&gt;🚀 Meta Llama 3.1-8B-Instruct: The Ultimate Guide to Advanced Language AI
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/646cf8084eefb026fb8fd8bc/oCTqufkdTkjyGodsx1vo1.png"
loading="lazy"
alt="Llama 3.1 Model"
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The flagship 8B parameter instruction-tuned model from Meta&amp;rsquo;s revolutionary Llama 3.1
collection&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-model-information"&gt;🧠 Model Information
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Meta Llama 3.1&lt;/strong&gt; collection represents a significant leap forward in multilingual large
language models (LLMs). This collection includes pretrained and instruction-tuned generative
models available in 8B, 70B, and 405B parameter sizes, all optimized for text-in/text-out
applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Specifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model Developer&lt;/strong&gt;: Meta&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: Auto-regressive transformer with optimized design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training Method&lt;/strong&gt;: Supervised Fine-Tuning (SFT) + Reinforcement Learning with Human Feedback
(RLHF)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Release Date&lt;/strong&gt;: July 23, 2024&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id="-technical-overview"&gt;📊 Technical Overview
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Feature&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Specification&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parameters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;8B&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training Data&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;New mix of publicly available online data&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Input Modalities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Multilingual Text&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Output Modalities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Multilingual Text and Code&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Context Length&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;128k tokens&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GQA Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Yes&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Token Count&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;15T+&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge Cutoff&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;December 2023&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h3 id="-supported-languages"&gt;🌍 Supported Languages
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Llama 3.1 natively supports &lt;strong&gt;8 languages&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;French&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Italian&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portuguese&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hindi&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spanish&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thai&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-intended-use-cases"&gt;🎯 Intended Use Cases
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="-primary-applications"&gt;✅ Primary Applications
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial and research use&lt;/strong&gt; across multiple languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assistant-like chat applications&lt;/strong&gt; for instruction-tuned models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Natural language generation tasks&lt;/strong&gt; for pretrained versions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Synthetic data generation&lt;/strong&gt; and model distillation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multilingual dialogue systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id="-out-of-scope-usage"&gt;❌ Out-of-Scope Usage
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Activities violating applicable laws or regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses prohibited by the Acceptable Use Policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Languages beyond the 8 explicitly supported ones (without proper fine-tuning)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-how-to-us"&gt;🛠️ How to Us
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="-with-transformers"&gt;💻 With Transformers
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ensure you have &lt;code&gt;transformers &amp;gt;= 4.43.0&lt;/code&gt; installed:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;pip install --upgrade transformers
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Usage Example:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;11
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;12
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;13
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;14
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;15
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kn"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nn"&gt;transformers&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kn"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nn"&gt;torch&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;model_id&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;meta-llama/Meta-Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;pipeline&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;transformers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;pipeline&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;text-generation&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;model&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;model_id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;model_kwargs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;torch_dtype&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;torch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;bfloat16&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;},&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;device_map&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;auto&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;messages&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;role&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;system&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;content&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;You are a pirate chatbot who always responds in pirate&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;speak&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;}, {&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;user&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;, &amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;content&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;Who&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;are&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;},&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;outputs&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;pipeline&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;messages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;max_new_tokens&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;256&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;outputs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;][&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;generated_text&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;][&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;])&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="-tool-use-integration"&gt;🔧 Tool Use Integration
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Llama 3.1 supports advanced tool integration through chat templates:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;10
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;11
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;12
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;13
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;14
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;15
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;16
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;17
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Define a tool function&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;get_current_temperature&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;str&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;-&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;float&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34; Get the current temperature at a location.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt; Args:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt; location: The location to get the temperature for, in the format &amp;#34;City, Country&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt; Returns:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt; The current temperature at the specified location in the specified units, as a float.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt; &amp;#34;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mf"&gt;22.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Example implementation&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Create chat with tool integration&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;messages&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;role&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;system&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;content&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;You are a bot that responds to weather queries.&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;},&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;role&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;user&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;content&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;Hey, what&amp;#39;s the temperature in Paris right now?&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;inputs&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;tokenizer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;apply_chat_template&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;messages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;get_current_temperature&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;],&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;add_generation_prompt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;True&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="-with-original-llama-codebase"&gt;📦 With Original Llama Codebase
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Download original checkpoints using:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;2
